<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Big League, the Elite Four\ngon’ test you. You gotta beat ALL of\f’em.\rLose ONCE and you start ALL over! No\ncheckpoints! No mercy! No refunds!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some Hustlers get scared\nand just leave.\rMy ABRA can take you home.\nBut...\rHustlers just Catch Flight home\nnowadays... I feel left out.\fMy ABRA feel the same way.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ABRA: Aabra...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hold up.\rYou finna take on the Big\nLeague right now?\rYou gon’ gotta forget that.\rMy trained-past-recognition\nhomies finna stomp you.\rRight here, right now!\nI’m callin’ you out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Oh, no... I still can’t\nwin after all that trainin’...\rI...I gotta believe more in my\nhomies...\r...It’s whatever.\nMy bad for gettin’ in the way.\rDon’t forget to heal your homies\nbefore you run up on the Kingpin!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Through this door is the Elite Four.\rThey CRAZY tough! Once you in, you\ncan’t leave. Like a timeshare pitch.\fYou ready?\fBe brave! I’ll pray! I’ll pray HARD!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Through this door is the Elite Four.\rThey CRAZY tough! Once you in, you\ncan’t leave. Like a timeshare pitch.\fYou ready?\fBe brave! I’ll pray! I’ll pray HARD!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0522_T10R0101_00007" index="7">
